        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-567_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-567_334486_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-779_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-779_334532_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-864_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-864_334489_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-874_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-874_334488_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-879_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-879_334487_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-969_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-969_334490_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1006_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1006_334492_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1193_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1193_334491_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1230_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1230_334493_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-567_334486_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>The amount reported on Page 200, Line 21, Column (c) contains both Amortization of Transmission Plant and Amortization of Intangible Plant as shown in the table below. </p><p>  1.) $514,204 Amortization of Transmission Plant<br />   2.) $14,336 Amortization of Intangible Plant<br />   3.) $0 Amortization of Other Utility Plant (Page 200, Line 21, Column (c)) </p><p>Transmission Accumulated Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 25, Column (c) <br />   4.) $5,801,877 Transmission Accumulated Depreciation (Page 219, Line 25, Column (c))</p><p>General Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 28, Column (c)<br />   5.) $57,281 General Depreciation (Page 219, Line 28, Column (c))</p><p>For Attachment O, Page 2, Line 8 (Transmission Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the Transmission items in 1.) and 4.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Workpaper 1, Line 13, Column (h) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment O. </p><p>For Attachment O, Page 2, Line 10 (General and Intangible Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the General and Intangible items in 2.) and 5.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Workpaper 1, Line 13, Column (i) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment O. <br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-779_334532_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the amount transferred from FERC account 303 to 397.2 as a result of FERC Order 898.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-864_334489_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>The amount reported on Page 200, Line 21, Column (c) contains both Amortization of Transmission Plant and Amortization of Intangible Plant as shown in the table below. </p><p>  1.) $514,204 Amortization of Transmission Plant<br />   2.) $14,336 Amortization of Intangible Plant<br />   3.) $0 Amortization of Other Utility Plant (Page 200, Line 21, Column (c)) </p><p>Transmission Accumulated Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 25, Column (c) <br />   4.) $5,801,877 Transmission Accumulated Depreciation (Page 219, Line 25, Column (c))</p><p>General Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 28, Column (c)<br />   5.) $57,281 General Depreciation (Page 219, Line 28, Column (c))</p><p>For Attachment O, Page 2, Line 8 (Transmission Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the Transmission items in 1.) and 4.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Workpaper 1, Line 13, Column (h) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment O. </p><p>For Attachment O, Page 2, Line 10 (General and Intangible Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the General and Intangible items in 2.) and 5.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Workpaper 1, Line 13, Column (i) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment O. </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-874_334488_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>The amount reported on Page 200, Line 21, Column (c) contains both Amortization of Transmission Plant and Amortization of Intangible Plant as shown in the table below. </p><p>  1.) $514,204 Amortization of Transmission Plant<br />   2.) $14,336 Amortization of Intangible Plant<br />   3.) $0 Amortization of Other Utility Plant (Page 200, Line 21, Column (c)) </p><p>Transmission Accumulated Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 25, Column (c) <br />   4.) $5,801,877 Transmission Accumulated Depreciation (Page 219, Line 25, Column (c))</p><p>General Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 28, Column (c)<br />   5.) $57,281 General Depreciation (Page 219, Line 28, Column (c))</p><p>For Attachment O, Page 2, Line 8 (Transmission Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the Transmission items in 1.) and 4.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Workpaper 1, Line 13, Column (h) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment O. </p><p>For Attachment O, Page 2, Line 10 (General and Intangible Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the General and Intangible items in 2.) and 5.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Workpaper 1, Line 13, Column (i) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment O. <br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-879_334487_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the amount transferred from FERC account 111 to 108 as a result of FERC Order 898.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-969_334490_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div class="excel-container" style="padding: 20px; overflow-x: auto; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">        <table class="excel-table e-rte-table">                <tr>            <td style="border: none"><br /></td><td style="border: none"><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="bold center-text" style="border: none">RECONCILIATION OF REPORTED NET INCOME</td>            <td style="border: none"><br /></td><td style="border: none"><br /></td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td style="border: none"><br /></td><td style="border: none"><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="bold center-text" style="border: none">WITH FEDERAL TAXABLE INCOME</td>            <td style="border: none"><br /></td><td style="border: none"><br /></td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td colspan="6" style="border: none"><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td>1.</td>            <td colspan="2">Net Income per Statement of Income</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">1,997,638</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td>2.</td>            <td colspan="2">Federal Income Taxes</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">385,526</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td>3.</td>            <td colspan="2">Excess Capital Loss over Capital Gain</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="dash-cell">-</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /