  <td colspan="2" class="indent-level">State income tax expense</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">57,879</td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level">Tax and indirect cost capitalization</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">43,214</td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level bold">Total Line 5</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell top-border">125,250</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="bold">6.</td>            <td colspan="2" class="bold">Total of Items 1-5</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell bold">2,508,414</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td>7.</td>            <td colspan="2">Income Recorded on Books not included on Return:</td>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level">AFUDC-equity</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">-51,526</td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level">AFUDC-debt</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">-18,974</td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level bold">Total Line 7</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell top-border">-70,500</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td>8.</td>            <td colspan="2">Deductions on Return not Charged Against Book Income:</td>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level">Depreciation expense</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">-1,538,095</td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level">Net operating loss carryforward</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="dash-cell">-</td>        </tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td><td><br /></td>            <td colspan="2" class="indent-level bold">Total Line 8</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell top-border">-1,538,095</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td>9.</td>            <td colspan="2">Total of Items 7 and 8</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell">-1,608,595</td>        </tr>        <tr class="spacer"><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr>        <tr>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="bold">10.</td>            <td colspan="2" class="bold">Federal Taxable Income</td>            <td><br /></td>            <td class="num-cell bold double-bottom">899,819</td>        </tr>    </table></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1006_334492_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The Companys formula rate template referenced page 262-263 column (i), but changes to the Form No. 1 page 262-263 have moved data to column (l). The Company received authorization to effectuate this change in its formula rate template in FERC Docket No. ER25-3430 effective November 15, 2025. As a result, formula rate postings prior to this date will still reference column (i) instead of column (l). <br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1193_334491_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Revenue earned from MISO per the revenue requirement for transmission services filed with FERC.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1230_334493_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The Companys formula rate template referenced Page 336, Line 7, Column (b), but the appropriate value is the sum of Page 336, Line 7, Column (b) and Column (d). The Company received authorization to effectuate this change in its formula rate template in FERC Docket No. ER25-3430 effective November 15, 2025. As a result, formula rate postings prior to this date will still reference Column (b) instead of the sum of Column (b) and Column (D). <br /></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>